WEBVTT

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.448
THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.937
EPISODE 85

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:50.568
Not even a year had passed
since I'd joined the company.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:53.488
I had a presentation the next day,

00:01:53.571 --> 00:01:56.032
so I was working late at the office
to prepare documents.

00:01:56.908 --> 00:02:00.829
I suddenly heard an awful creaking,
and in the next moment,

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:04.082
I froze. I couldn't move.

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:06.918
I broke out into a cold sweat.

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:10.463
"Help! Someone, help!"

00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:14.217
I don't know how much time passed.

00:02:14.717 --> 00:02:16.803
The computer had completely frozen.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.722
It was also getting light outside.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:24.310
Hold up, Boss Lady.
That's the wrong kind of "scary."

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:26.813
What? But it was scary!

00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:29.190
I said we should tell ghost stories.

00:02:29.774 --> 00:02:34.571
Honestly, I probably shouldn't be
telling people this story.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:39.325
I heard it years ago
from one of the older guys back home.

00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:43.037
There's a well-known haunted building
in my hometown.

00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:45.665
A bunch of guys
decided to go there on a dare.

00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:47.333
So they went to the…

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.587
What's the word? You know,
when a building isn't…

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.173
When a building is unused. You know?

00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:54.757
Oh, "abandoned."

00:02:55.383 --> 00:02:58.011
Once inside, they started going down
a narrow corridor.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:03.725
It was mid-summer, but one of the guys
started shivering saying, "It's so cold!"

00:03:03.808 --> 00:03:05.560
"What are you talking about?"

00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:08.438
Another guy shone his…
You know, the thing?

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:11.774
The thing that lights up
when you push the button.

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:15.737
And behind him he saw… You know?

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:22.201
A long-haired woman wearing one of those
"I can just throw it on" outfits.

00:03:22.785 --> 00:03:25.121
But something wasn't right.

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:28.541
Her height was… How tall was it?

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.920
You know?
As tall as an NBA player, you know?

00:03:32.921 --> 00:03:34.547
Then the next thing they knew,

00:03:34.631 --> 00:03:36.591
she was on all fours like… You know?

00:03:36.674 --> 00:03:39.510
Like an animal?
Anyway, just crazy, you know?

00:03:39.594 --> 00:03:41.846
Then, crash!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.098
The next thing they knew, it was morning.

00:03:44.182 --> 00:03:49.395
They woke up in… You know?
One of those places lots of cars park.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.314
Uh, I couldn't really follow that.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.943
That made no sense.
What happened towards the end?

00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:56.819
It was just crazy!

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.821
So I'm last, huh?

00:03:59.656 --> 00:04:02.492
I'll tell you a tale of a curse.

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:04.327
It happened just the other day.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.038
It was a damp, rainy day.

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:09.332
I was dozing off

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:13.002
when I heard lively music
coming from the TV.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:17.465
Fresh snow crabs from Hokkaido
are now on sale! Three for 10,000 yen!

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:22.053
I froze as if a gun had been pulled on me.

00:04:22.136 --> 00:04:23.680
They were so cheap!

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:26.683
I was suddenly hit
with symptoms of withdrawal.

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.768
Just as I thought I'd quelled the urge…

00:04:28.851 --> 00:04:29.686
That's not all!

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:33.398
We'll throw in another set
for the same price!

00:04:34.357 --> 00:04:35.858
It was terrifying.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.736
Before I knew it,
I was ordering the goods.

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:42.156
The haul arrived a few days later.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.951
I tried to tamp down my excitement

00:04:45.034 --> 00:04:47.412
as I put away the stuff in the freezer.

00:04:47.996 --> 00:04:49.372
That's when I noticed them.

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.332
Deep in the freezer,

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:54.168
I found some frost-covered ziplock bags.

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:55.962
That's right.

00:04:56.045 --> 00:04:59.882
I'd ordered the exact same stuff
one year ago and forgotten about it!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.094
I shuddered in horror.

00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:07.181
I'd been cursed by crabs
who'd been buried alive and forgotten.

00:05:08.349 --> 00:05:10.768
Forgive me, crabs…

00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:13.229
Isn't that just a story
about being forgetful?

00:05:13.312 --> 00:05:15.690
And those freshly-delivered crabs?

00:05:16.357 --> 00:05:18.693
-I made them into a hot pot.
-Yay!

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.321
The Way of the Househusband!

00:05:23.781 --> 00:05:24.615
EPISODE 86

00:05:24.699 --> 00:05:25.658
KATAGI PARK

00:05:25.742 --> 00:05:27.618
So that kid's the target?

00:05:27.702 --> 00:05:30.413
Yes. Her name's Suzu.

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:33.333
Five years old. My beloved daughter.

00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:34.959
Take a look at this.

00:05:35.043 --> 00:05:39.047
Suzu can't stand vegetables.
Plus, I'm not a good cook.

00:05:39.964 --> 00:05:43.009
I just want that kid
to eat some vegetables somehow.

00:05:43.801 --> 00:05:45.803
By any means necessary?

00:05:48.556 --> 00:05:51.476
Hey, Suzu, what do you have there?

00:05:51.559 --> 00:05:53.436
I'm cooking!

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:55.313
Please have some!

00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:57.190
Wow, is that a hamburger patty?

00:05:57.273 --> 00:05:58.608
Chomp, chomp.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:01.027
Mmm, this is first-rate stuff.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.820
My brain's on a high.

00:06:02.904 --> 00:06:06.532
Now if we had a carrot for garnish,
it would add color--

00:06:07.116 --> 00:06:08.493
What did you just say?

00:06:08.576 --> 00:06:09.744
Huh?

00:06:09.827 --> 00:06:11.245
-Add color?
-Before that.

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:13.915
Car… rot…

00:06:13.998 --> 00:06:16.375
Never say that word again.

00:06:17.418 --> 00:06:18.294
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:20.671 --> 00:06:24.550
She's no stranger to this game.
That aura's really something.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:27.804
Exactly. She'll crush your soul
without hesitation.

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:29.972
Stand your ground.

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:31.849
It's do or die.

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.561
Suzu, it's lunchtime!

00:06:36.312 --> 00:06:39.065
I made you a special kid's lunch platter!

00:06:39.148 --> 00:06:41.984
Yay, it looks delicious!

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.820
I love hamburger patties!

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:46.531
Nothing suspicious in there, right?

00:06:47.532 --> 00:06:50.701
Of course not.
That patty is 100% pure beef.

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:51.911
Not cut with anything!

00:06:51.994 --> 00:06:55.289
Then what's this onion
doing in here? Well?

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:58.501
I finely ground them to hide them,
but she noticed?!

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:01.712
Oh, I heard you like curry too!

00:07:01.796 --> 00:07:02.880
This curry here--

00:07:02.964 --> 00:07:04.382
I can smell it.

00:07:05.216 --> 00:07:09.345
It's been ground into a paste and boiled,
but there's carrot hidden in here.

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:12.640
This kid's sense of smell…
She's like a drug-sniffer dog!

00:07:12.723 --> 00:07:14.142
There's green pepper in this.

00:07:14.225 --> 00:07:15.268
Spinach in this.

00:07:16.394 --> 00:07:17.228
No…

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.981
Didn't think I'd know?

00:07:20.064 --> 00:07:22.442
Her clearance rate is 100%!

00:07:22.525 --> 00:07:24.902
Anything to say for yourself?

00:07:25.486 --> 00:07:26.612
This…

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:34.370
Little Carrot was raised lovingly
by the farmer.

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:39.083
But no matter what,
children were always mean to him.

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.961
He just wanted them to like him.

00:07:42.044 --> 00:07:44.046
Little Carrot fretted.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.132
Here's what he said.

00:07:47.091 --> 00:07:51.220
"Children love curry.
Please, mix me into a curry."

00:07:52.221 --> 00:07:54.640
"Then everyone will gladly eat me."

00:07:55.266 --> 00:07:59.520
He smiled, somewhat sadly.

00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:02.398
Little Carrot…

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:03.858
Well, just a little--

00:08:03.941 --> 00:08:06.611
Little Carrot got shredded in the blender

00:08:07.278 --> 00:08:10.698
and drowned in the depths
of a boiling pot of curry.

00:08:10.781 --> 00:08:13.659
Too much. The last bit was too much.

00:08:13.743 --> 00:08:14.577
CARROT

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.245
The Way of the Househusband!

00:08:18.748 --> 00:08:21.167
EPISODE 87

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.502
Phew!

00:08:22.585 --> 00:08:25.588
Mr. Landlord. You're battling the weeds?

00:08:25.671 --> 00:08:27.131
Oh, hello Tatsu.

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:30.843
Let me help. I can call in the troops.

00:08:32.929 --> 00:08:35.806
Weeding? Leave it to me!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.808
I'll leave that turf over there to you!

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:40.269
Let the battle begin!

00:08:41.479 --> 00:08:42.480
What's wrong?!

00:08:44.273 --> 00:08:46.067
Damn weeds.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.194
They had spiked weapons up their sleeves!

00:08:48.277 --> 00:08:49.987
You idiot!

00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:52.698
Never underestimate thorny weeds!

00:08:52.782 --> 00:08:54.533
Don't go for hand-to-hand combat.

00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:56.494
Make sure you're well-armed too!

00:08:56.577 --> 00:08:59.205
Bring it on!

00:09:00.331 --> 00:09:01.541
Ah, youth.

00:09:03.584 --> 00:09:04.710
Take this!

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:13.219
I took care of these guys, Boss.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:17.098
Look, the roots are still there.

00:09:17.181 --> 00:09:19.976
They'll just spring back.

00:09:20.476 --> 00:09:22.812
You gotta pull up the roots.

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:27.483
Finish 'em off with this special mix
I made from vinegar and detergent!

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:29.819
What? We can use vinegar?!

00:09:29.902 --> 00:09:32.947
Vinegar's high acidity
works well against weeds!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.284
It's easy to make
and harmless for kids and pets!

00:09:36.867 --> 00:09:38.369
SHOOSH

00:09:40.162 --> 00:09:41.205
Take that!

00:09:41.289 --> 00:09:43.124
Knew you could do it, Boss!

00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:44.500
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:09:45.835 --> 00:09:47.461
Kinda stinks, doesn't it?

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.172
Hey, you two-- Oh, something stinks.

00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:52.466
Let's take a break.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:53.592
Thanks.

00:09:53.676 --> 00:09:54.510
All right!

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:57.722
-I made some vinegar juice for you.
-Vinegar, again?

00:09:58.806 --> 00:10:01.559
Apple cider vinegar juice, huh? Very nice.

00:10:03.602 --> 00:10:07.648
The citric acid in vinegar
is good for relieving fatigue,

00:10:07.732 --> 00:10:11.402
and the antioxidants suppress
the increase in blood sugar levels.

00:10:11.485 --> 00:10:14.697
It's good for your skin
and helps prevent osteoporosis.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.490
But you shouldn't drink too much.

00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:18.784
It can irritate your throat and stomach.

00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:22.997
It can also erode tooth enamel,
so be sure to keep up dental hygiene.

00:10:27.501 --> 00:10:29.629
I don't like this taste.

00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:37.136
My rhino beetle's stronger than yours!

00:10:37.219 --> 00:10:39.847
No way, my stag beetle's tougher!

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.183
Now, now. Don't fight.

00:10:42.266 --> 00:10:43.559
What do you think, Tatsu?

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:47.229
Listen, the rhino is the godfather
of the insect world.

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:49.523
Cross him and you won't survive the woods.

00:10:50.274 --> 00:10:51.776
The Insect Godfather?

00:10:51.859 --> 00:10:54.236
Don't underestimate the stag, punk!

00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:57.990
You ever experience
a stag beetle's pincers?

00:10:58.074 --> 00:11:01.702
-It'll slice your fingers off!
-That's an exaggeration.

00:11:01.786 --> 00:11:04.205
You picking a battle with the beetle boss?

00:11:04.288 --> 00:11:07.416
Noobs like you who don't know
what stags can do should back off.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.626
THUD

00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:11.629
The rhino's so big, you'd never beat it!

00:11:11.712 --> 00:11:13.881
You want your finger snipped
by the stag's pincers?!

00:11:13.964 --> 00:11:16.008
That's enough, Tatsu.

00:11:16.092 --> 00:11:18.844
There's no turning back
after all those fighting words.

00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:21.514
Boy, I'll bring you back its head!

00:11:21.597 --> 00:11:22.431
I'm good.

00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:25.559
-It's the war of the bugs!
-Are you even listening?

00:11:27.978 --> 00:11:30.648
He's a looker.

00:11:30.731 --> 00:11:31.857
Pretty cool, huh?

00:11:31.941 --> 00:11:33.567
Come on, beetle.

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:36.612
Let's show 'em who's boss!

00:11:37.988 --> 00:11:39.573
Did you make that?

00:11:39.657 --> 00:11:43.452
Boiled down some rice liquor
with brown sugar. It'll drive him wild.

00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:44.412
We got beetle food.

00:11:44.495 --> 00:11:46.539
All right, let's smash 'em!

00:11:46.622 --> 00:11:48.249
No pain, no gain!

00:11:49.291 --> 00:11:51.752
Let's toast with these exquisite crêpes!

00:11:51.836 --> 00:11:54.088
Actually, I don't wanna spoil my dinner.

00:11:54.672 --> 00:11:57.508
Come on, kid,
we'll take the crown with the stag.

00:11:57.591 --> 00:11:58.884
Can you leave, please?

00:11:58.968 --> 00:12:00.344
Hello, ma'am!

00:12:00.428 --> 00:12:03.848
Takuya and I are gonna overthrow
the power hierarchy of the forest!

00:12:03.931 --> 00:12:06.725
I see, the forest…

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:08.310
Who is this person?

00:12:09.937 --> 00:12:12.815
You dare to show up
after challenging a rhino?

00:12:12.898 --> 00:12:15.109
Strong only in name, numb-nuts!

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:18.362
Go whack 'em!

00:12:18.446 --> 00:12:20.531
Rip 'em in two!

00:12:20.614 --> 00:12:23.242
-These grown-ups sure have energy.
-Here's the Miyama stag!

00:12:23.826 --> 00:12:26.203
Okay. Ready? Fight!

00:12:26.287 --> 00:12:27.163
CLASH

00:12:27.746 --> 00:12:29.123
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

00:12:29.707 --> 00:12:31.417
All right! Smash it around!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.377
Send it back to the slammer!

00:12:33.461 --> 00:12:34.587
Crazies are around.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.797
Whoa! The stag's on top!

00:12:36.881 --> 00:12:40.426
Now's the chance!
Magnum Inside-Grip Arm Throw!

00:12:40.509 --> 00:12:44.388
It fell for it! Fingertip Clip Guillotine!

00:12:44.472 --> 00:12:45.848
CLICK CLICK

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.308
WHIZZ

00:12:50.728 --> 00:12:52.354
The Way of the Househusband!

00:12:54.356 --> 00:12:58.611
People just don't shop
at places like ours anymore.

00:12:58.694 --> 00:12:59.987
Yes, it's the same with us.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:03.949
Why not? Your blades are top-notch, pops.

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:07.119
People can find everything they need
at shopping malls.

00:13:07.203 --> 00:13:08.454
It might be time.

00:13:08.537 --> 00:13:11.665
We can't stand by
while our turf's being laid to waste!

00:13:11.749 --> 00:13:14.251
Tatsu, what are you planning?!

00:13:14.752 --> 00:13:15.586
THUD

00:13:15.669 --> 00:13:16.754
I may not look it,

00:13:16.837 --> 00:13:19.798
but I dabbled in some street selling
in the past.

00:13:19.882 --> 00:13:21.759
Gather round, gather round!

00:13:21.842 --> 00:13:26.222
If you're not in a rush,
come over and have a listen!

00:13:26.305 --> 00:13:28.098
What? What's this?

00:13:28.182 --> 00:13:29.016
What's going on?

00:13:29.099 --> 00:13:30.184
Some product demo?

00:13:30.267 --> 00:13:33.395
Lo and behold, the all-purpose knife!

00:13:33.479 --> 00:13:37.608
Made in Japan,
theland of pristine soil and seas!

00:13:37.691 --> 00:13:40.402
This steel is on another level
to anything else!

00:13:40.486 --> 00:13:43.280
Is it just another dull knife
where only the tip can cut?

00:13:43.364 --> 00:13:45.407
Or can it even slice solid bamboo?!

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:47.409
It won't bend! It won't warp!

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:50.704
All this and it didn't even
blunt the blade!

00:13:50.788 --> 00:13:51.705
-Yikes!
-Yikes!

00:13:51.789 --> 00:13:55.084
Come buy this sharp knife!

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:56.919
A rock-hard squash!

00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:58.879
A tender tomato!

00:13:58.963 --> 00:14:02.591
Peeling an apple! You can cut anything!

00:14:02.675 --> 00:14:05.052
For filleting fish!

00:14:05.135 --> 00:14:06.554
For yubitsume and raids!

00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:08.222
For chopping chicken with skin!

00:14:08.305 --> 00:14:10.057
Cut anything you want!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.600
Something was out of place.

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:12.685
I'll take one.

00:14:13.852 --> 00:14:15.729
Roll up, roll up! Cheap as chips!

00:14:15.813 --> 00:14:17.815
Everything starts from one!

00:14:17.898 --> 00:14:20.693
Quarrels start wars! Then come the cuffs!

00:14:20.776 --> 00:14:22.653
Don't wanna be ripped off?

00:14:22.736 --> 00:14:26.407
Wear this Policure sweater!
Starting at 6,000 yen!

00:14:27.032 --> 00:14:27.866
Alrighty.

00:14:28.576 --> 00:14:31.120
Let's drop it a notch to 5,000 yen.
How about it?

00:14:31.203 --> 00:14:33.664
Perfect for the upcoming season!

00:14:33.747 --> 00:14:36.166
Wear it at home!
Wear it shopping out in town!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.127
Wear it at a little party!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.629
One of these and you'll be a hero!

00:14:40.713 --> 00:14:42.339
Even Yakuza will step aside!

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:46.760
Isn't that last season's merch?

00:14:47.803 --> 00:14:49.680
-What's going on?
-Who's that?

00:14:49.763 --> 00:14:53.517
I'm not doing this for money!
I'll give you a discount!

00:14:53.601 --> 00:14:56.270
How about 4,000 yen!
Let's settle it with 4,000!

00:14:56.353 --> 00:14:57.980
No way, we're at 4,000 yen!

00:14:59.607 --> 00:15:01.442
It's not worth selling.

00:15:01.525 --> 00:15:05.654
Fine! Make it two, you thief!

00:15:07.698 --> 00:15:08.574
I'll buy it.

